<title>USA: Creative Host Service CFO resigns.</title>
<headline>Creative Host Service CFO resigns.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Creative Host Services Inc said Wednesday its Chief Financial Officer Fred Kaplan has resigned, citing personal reasons.</p>
<p>Kaplan had been chief financial officer at Creative Host Services since February 1. The company said in a statement that Kaplan has agreed to provide financial consulting services for four months.</p>
<p>Creative Host operates food, beverage and other concessions at airports throughout the United States.</p>
